\n\n建议：目标盘启用了 BitLocker。请先在「管理员命令提示符」里挂起保护，然后重试：\n    manage-bde -protectors -disable X: -rebootcount 1\n（X 换成目标盘符。还原会覆盖该盘数据，之后不需要恢复保护。）=\n\nAdvice: the target drive has BitLocker enabled. Suspend protection first in an "administrative Command Prompt", then retry:\n    manage-bde -protectors -disable X: -rebootcount 1\n(Replace X with the target drive letter. Restoring overwrites this drive, so protection does not have to be resumed afterwards.)
